[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/187","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/187/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/187/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/187/events","html_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/issues/187","id":5408267454,"node_id":"I_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABQlucvg","number":187,"title":"Projects: configurable roadmap range and default zoom","user":{"login":"td72","id":12109493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12109493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72","html_url":"https://github.com/td72","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10179374926,"node_id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"description":"New feature or request"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-10T05:39:07Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T05:39:07Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Motivation\n\nThe roadmap's timeline starts two days before the earliest span of any item, so one old item stretches the visible range far into the past; the default zoom (week, one cell per day) then shows only a slice of what matters.\n\n## Spec\n\n1. **`projects-roadmap { start \"<offset>\"; zoom \"month\" | \"week\" | \"day\" }`** — a top-level node. `start` is relative to today (`\"-7d\"`, `\"-1m\"`, `\"0d\"`; the current behaviour is the default when absent); items starting earlier are clipped on the left and reachable with `h`. `zoom` is the initial scale (default `week`).\n2. **Per view** — the same `roadmap { … }` child inside a `projects-view` overrides the top-level one for that view.\n3. Docs (Config Reference en / ja with CI-verified examples, the Projects chapter), the Projects demo tape.\n\nRelated: hiding done items (#185) already shrinks the range in most boards; this issue covers the remaining cases.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/187/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/187/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}]
